---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+15805550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(580) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Refrigerant Leak Repair in Ardmore, OK" description="Professional refrigerant leak detection and repair in Ardmore, OK. Proper EPA recovery and recharge.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Refrigerant Leak Repair</h1>
      <p>Locate the source fast and restore proper charge without shortcuts.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>Low refrigerant is almost always caused by a leak. Simply adding more refrigerant without finding and fixing the leak is a temporary fix that wastes money and harms the environment. We use electronic detectors and proper methods to locate and repair leaks.</p>
      <h2>Our Process</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Electronic leak detection</li>
        <li>Proper EPA refrigerant recovery</li>
        <li>Repair of coils, lines, or fittings</li>
        <li>Correct recharge to manufacturer specs</li>
        <li>Honest advice on repair vs. replace</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready to Schedule?</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>{phoneDisplay}</a> for refrigerant service in Ardmore, OK.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
